  - if empty → skip
  - bill = find(owner, month)
  - if bill == null → create OPEN bill
  - if bill.status == OPEN → add items, mark billed
  - else (SETTLED/PAID) → create adjustment "结算后补录" with items, mark billed

This gives idempotency: generating twice — second time no unbilled events → no change.

